   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 141 of the laws of 2014 amending the environmental\nconservation law relating to authorizing the hunting of big game in the county\nof Albany with rifles, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S10542",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S10542-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §3, Chap 141 of 2014",
    "lawSection": "Environmental Conservation",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S10542\n\nSPONSOR: FAHY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 141 of the laws of 2014 amending the environ-\nmental conservation law relating to authorizing the hunting of big game\nin the county of Albany with rifles, in relation to the effectiveness\nthereof\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo extend the effectiveness of authorizing big game hunting in Albany\nCounty.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of this bill would amend subdivision (c) of section 3 of chap-\nter 141 of the laws of 2014 to extend the provisions of the act until\nOctober 1, 2028, upon which date the act shall expire.\n\nSection 2 of this bill provides that the bill shall take effect imme-\ndiately.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation extends the authorization to allow for hunting big game\nin Albany County with rifles in all areas of the county except Wildlife\nManagement Unit 4J, which is archery-only and encompasses the City of\nAlbany and adjacent populated and suburban areas.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2024: Chapter 258 (S.9737/A.10133)\n\n2021: Chapter 119 (A.6389/S.5725)\n\n2018: Chapter 160 (S.8162/A.10342)\n\n2014: Chapter 141\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
